        },
        "description_LiLpi4": {
          "type": "description",
          "settings": {
            "description_text": "<p>Once Damian’s invention proved useful, he turned his creative focus to other areas of construction and masonry markets, eventually releasing the Mud Hog®, Uphill Grout Hog®, Hog Slopper®, Hog Legs®, Hog Trough® and Booger Hog®. In the early 2000’s Damian broke into the fencing industry with the introduction of the Fence Hog® – which now includes several models designed to save contractors thousands of dollars and man hours required to complete jobs.</p>"
