            "custom_code": "",
            "title": "CONTRACT MANUFACTURING",
            "description": "<p>Derived from our manufacturing roots, EZG is a state-of-the-art contract manufacturing shop that can handle virtually every metal fabrication process. From bending and press braking to laser-cutting and machining. We believe in working closely with customers to ensure we provide a solution to meet your needs with the highest quality possible.</p><p></p>",
