        "description_MYyz68": {
          "type": "description",
          "settings": {
            "description": "<p>The safety of our employees and customers is our company’s greatest responsibilities. We complete projects at a fast rate, but never at the expense of our employees’ safety. We always adhere to the following policies:</p><ul><li>We are committed to providing a safe work environment for all of our employees.</li><li>We expect each employee to be responsible for their safety and to be held accountable for the safety of the people and equipment around them.</li><li>We expect each employee to: promote safety to others, report all hazards to a supervisor, use appropriate protective equipment and follow established production procedures at all times.</li></ul><p>At EZG we hold quarterly safety meetings and have third parties provide us with shop inspections and auto metric testing. We also have random in-house safety audits by our safety team.All equipment is reviewed by a safety standards check to make sure every part is accurate and each piece of equipment has all of the correct warning labels. All equipment includes a manual with safety procedures and warnings for our customers.</p>"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
